  "question": {
    "text": "All the edges of a block with parallel faces are unequal. Its largest edge is twice its shortest edge. What is the ratio of the maximum to the minimum resistance between parallel faces?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the length of various edges in increase order be <math><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi></math> respectively<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
